    <string name="import_backup_warning_body">"A backup saves the current sign-in tokens, not a permanent login. After you import and log in to a PTC account on this device, PTC replaces those tokens and revokes the ones in the old backup. That file will no longer sign you in to that account.

Before deleting accounts or uninstalling Eevx to reinstall it, create a fresh backup from the device where the accounts still work. You cannot do this after deleting them."</string>
